00:18:48.471 --> 00:18:50.890
Do you guys have roller skates?

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.750
- I think we have a pair round.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:53.970
- Uh-huh, lemme ask you a question.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.569
How fast do you think I have
to be going on roller skates

00:18:55.569 --> 00:18:56.721
to get past a couple of armored guards

00:18:56.721 --> 00:18:59.642
and still be going fast enough
to smash through a safe door?

00:18:59.642 --> 00:19:00.906
- One of those big bank safes?

00:19:00.906 --> 00:19:02.156
- No.

00:19:02.156 --> 00:19:02.989
I don't, I don't know.

00:19:02.989 --> 00:19:03.906
Yeah, yeah?

00:19:05.505 --> 00:19:08.148
Uh, hey, you guys got
one of those, you know,

00:19:08.148 --> 00:19:09.018
just one of those big bags

00:19:09.018 --> 00:19:10.794
with a dollar sign on the side of it?

00:19:10.794 --> 00:19:12.186
- Okay.

00:19:12.186 --> 00:19:13.724
- (clears throat) Yeah.

00:19:13.724 --> 00:19:15.845
- You're gonna shoot arrows
with shotgun shells attached

00:19:15.845 --> 00:19:18.152
to 'em to a bank window
to blow out the glass.

00:19:18.152 --> 00:19:20.266
Then, you're gonna shoot a
zip line through that window,

00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:22.519
and you're gonna slide
on into the hallway.

00:19:22.519 --> 00:19:24.896
You're gonna be wearing roller
skates so you can just skate

00:19:24.896 --> 00:19:27.776
on past the armed guards,
who will be shooting at you,

00:19:27.776 --> 00:19:30.117
and you're gonna hope that
they both won't hit your legs,

00:19:30.117 --> 00:19:32.106
and if they are aiming at your torso,

00:19:32.106 --> 00:19:34.786
the suit of medieval armor
will deflect the bullets.

00:19:34.786 --> 00:19:36.905
Then, you're gonna hope to
gather enough speed to burst

00:19:36.905 --> 00:19:39.346
through the big bank vault
at the end of the hallway

00:19:39.346 --> 00:19:44.346
where you're gonna collect the
money in a cartoon money bag.

00:19:46.445 --> 00:19:47.683
- Well, no, I'm just an uncle who's buying

00:19:47.683 --> 00:19:48.706
some (censored) for Christmas,

00:19:48.706 --> 00:19:50.605
and I, uh, think I'll take
my business elsewhere.

00:19:50.605 --> 00:19:51.981
Okay, merry Christmas.

00:19:51.981 --> 00:19:52.814
- It's April.

00:19:52.814 --> 00:19:54.165
(bell chimes)

00:19:54.165 --> 00:19:56.665
(funky music)

00:19:59.493 --> 00:20:01.837
♪ All I want is ♪

00:20:01.837 --> 00:20:03.865
♪ But I don't need you ♪

